    "src": "/images/scenes/museum-field-trip.webp",
    "alt": "一群國中生在挑高的歷史博物館大廳集合，學生們拿著筆記本記錄展品解說，周圍陳列著古文明陶器與石雕展櫃，氣氛熱絡專注。",
    "width": 1536,
    "height": 1024
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Today, our class arrives at the "
        },
        {
          "text": "history",
          "wordIds": [
            "history"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " "
        },
        {
          "text": "museum",
          "wordIds": [
            "museum"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " for an exciting field trip."
        }
      ],
      "translation": "今天，我們班來到歷史博物館進行令人興奮的校外教學。",
      "audio": {
        "src": "/audio/sentences/museum-field-trip/1.mp3",
        "voiceId": "kokoro-af-heart-v1",
        "textSha256": "4c8b8ea811f692a18fec22696032250f373ced2b32ea186c038e87619237dda4",
        "sha256": "e149f600688635f2c1d313320f20694bf42966d1feddd5d50865edb22ac144f2"
      }
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "A friendly museum "
        },
        {
          "text": "guide",
          "wordIds": [
            "guide"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " welcomes our "
        },
        {
          "text": "group",
          "wordIds": [
            "group"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " at the entrance and gives us maps."
        }
      ],
      "translation": "一位親切的博物館導覽員在門口迎接我們這組，並發給大家地圖。",
      "audio": {
        "src": "/audio/sentences/museum-field-trip/2.mp3",
        "voiceId": "kokoro-af-heart-v1",
        "textSha256": "68ec12f856df8bf0af200f4a738c957cec9978e4e5e2971b955ddf306eae2dd4",
        "sha256": "20465e17aaeec843fb3d85588388c9c62764ab79ed0f25f93fe0d6d53a2cdc53"
      }
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Before we explore the galleries, Mr. Chen reminds us, “"
        },
        {
          "text": "Take some ",
          "phraseIds": [
            "take-some-notes"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "notes",
          "phraseIds": [
            "take-some-notes"
          ],
          "wordIds": [
            "note"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "phraseIds": [
            "take-some-notes"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "”"
        }
      ],
      "translation": "在我們探索展廳之前，陳老師提醒大家：「做些筆記。」",
      "audio": {
        "src": "/audio/sentences/museum-field-trip/3.mp3",
        "voiceId": "kokoro-af-heart-v1",
        "textSha256": "ccc056663f1c0fb8611d1c60f84084d4e391c570648e1238c50f0deb2252e895",
        "sha256": "1f3f2326a4f514ca75e18f4efd83f240ff8b31f94bc67cbd223feb9ce45aa350"
      }
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Inside the ancient hall, Leo points to a glass case and whispers, “"
        },
        {
          "text": "Look at this ",
          "phraseIds": [
            "look-at-this-exhibit"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "exhibit",
          "phraseIds": [
            "look-at-this-exhibit"
          ],
          "wordIds": [
            "exhibit"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "phraseIds": [
            "look-at-this-exhibit"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "”"
        }
      ],
      "translation": "在古代展廳裡，Leo 指著玻璃櫃悄悄說：「看這個展覽品。」",
      "audio": {
        "src": "/audio/sentences/museum-field-trip/4.mp3",
        "voiceId": "kokoro-af-heart-v1",
        "textSha256": "8ff3e6bd45ecedee040dc620fc1a77433fba6a8bd7d5f48a4a52b2fa4216541c",
        "sha256": "5e98eebadde462bda10e58e560891989db771f77fa7151a8a387c4b8e33a3071"
      }
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "We admire a rare gold bowl from thousands of years ago and write down facts about it."
        }
      ],
      "translation": "我們欣賞著一件數千年前的珍貴黃金碗，並記錄下關於它的歷史資訊。",
      "audio": {
        "src": "/audio/sentences/museum-field-trip/5.mp3",
        "voiceId": "kokoro-af-heart-v1",
        "textSha256": "a1cadf1cdc1d5a814c52152f7a4484bea4cf67cabc93d40243a03ec17626654d",
        "sha256": "8d5cd88eaf299e9417c26a48a6017da952da1b32bbd1102c104015f87ffd0a0b"
      }
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "As lunchtime approaches, Emily raises her hand and asks, “"
        },
        {
          "text": "Where should we meet?",
          "phraseIds": [
            "where-should-we-meet"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "”"
        }
      ],
      "translation": "午餐時間快到了，Emily 舉手問道：「我們應該在哪裡集合？」",
      "audio": {
        "src": "/audio/sentences/museum-field-trip/6.mp3",
        "voiceId": "kokoro-af-heart-v1",
        "textSha256": "e45eb595fb6bacccdd241e7f144f981566d8d0f5e7087b190ce34a98748a7007",
        "sha256": "e46bb865f90d412ce97da5111aff88eb8372950c138dad68f93b190ea9a94d6f"
      }
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Mr. Chen smiles and announces, “By the main gate at noon. "
        },
        {
          "text": "Don't be late.",
          "phraseIds": [
            "dont-be-late"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "”"
        }
      ],
      "translation": "陳老師微笑著宣布：「中午在正門口集合。別遲到。」",
      "audio": {
        "src": "/audio/sentences/museum-field-trip/7.mp3",
        "voiceId": "kokoro-af-heart-v1",
        "textSha256": "e26f27343d3bda04ca9a184f68fd296c1cfb23620f139764a1afd0f2cc8e5a52",
        "sha256": "02a35518d4dc2c4cf6c25ba4ef4ca19177cc26e9033c4c40167f5db1f73cda83"
      }
    }
  ],
